WEBVTT

00:00:12.974 --> 00:00:14.713
- What's your name?
- Michael.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:17.228
Your hand's gonna be fine, Michael.

00:00:17.395 --> 00:00:20.020
Yeah. It's not as bad as it seems. See?

00:00:20.607 --> 00:00:21.769
It's fading already.

00:00:22.817 --> 00:00:27.530
You can hardly see ours anymore,
and the pain stops after a while.

00:00:34.913 --> 00:00:37.624
As I told you once before, Mr. Potter...

00:00:37.832 --> 00:00:41.246
...naughty children
deserve to be punished.

00:00:44.631 --> 00:00:45.882
You know, George...

00:00:46.049 --> 00:00:47.509
...I've always felt our
futures lay outside

00:00:47.676 --> 00:00:49.399
the world of academic achievement.

00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:53.277
Fred, I've been thinking
exactly the same thing.

00:02:06.504 --> 00:02:08.173
All right, professor!

00:02:16.931 --> 00:02:18.725
Here you go.

00:02:30.779 --> 00:02:32.238
Aah!

00:02:43.666 --> 00:02:45.502
Ready when you are.

00:04:11.254 --> 00:04:14.507
I need that prophecy.

00:04:14.674 --> 00:04:16.551
You'll have to kill me.

00:04:17.343 --> 00:04:21.031
Oh, I will.
But first, you will fetch it for me.

00:04:21.968 --> 00:04:23.808
-Crucio.
-Aah!

00:04:26.352 --> 00:04:28.688
-Crucio.
-Aahh!

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:40.950
Sirius.

00:04:41.117 --> 00:04:42.285
Harry, are you sure?

00:04:42.452 --> 00:04:44.746
I saw it. It's just like with Mr. Weasley.

00:04:44.913 --> 00:04:46.789
It's the door I've been dreaming about.

00:04:46.956 --> 00:04:48.652
I couldn't remember
where I'd seen it before.

00:04:48.789 --> 00:04:50.667
Sirius said Voldemort
was after something.

00:04:51.294 --> 00:04:54.589
Something he didn't have the last time,
in the Department of Mysteries.

00:04:54.756 --> 00:04:56.716
Harry, please, just listen.

00:04:58.218 --> 00:05:00.220
What if Voldemort
meant for you to see this?

00:05:01.512 --> 00:05:03.771
What if he's only hurting Sirius
because he's trying to get to you?

00:05:04.037 --> 00:05:07.321
What if he is?
I'm supposed to just let him die?

00:05:08.478 --> 00:05:11.051
Hermione,
he's the only family I've got left.

00:05:14.525 --> 00:05:15.610
What do we do?

00:05:16.945 --> 00:05:18.571
We'll have to use the Floo Network.

00:05:18.738 --> 00:05:20.507
Umbridge has the chimneys
under surveillance.

00:05:20.855 --> 00:05:22.217
Not all of them.

00:05:25.411 --> 00:05:26.746
Alohomora.

00:05:37.966 --> 00:05:39.634
Alert the Order if you can.

00:05:39.801 --> 00:05:41.189
Are you mental? We're going with you.

00:05:41.356 --> 00:05:43.169
It's too dangerous.

00:05:43.638 --> 00:05:47.225
When are you going to get it
into your head? We're in this together.

00:05:47.392 --> 00:05:49.443
That you are.

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:52.798
Caught this one
trying to help the Weasley girl.

00:05:58.653 --> 00:06:00.410
You were going to Dumbledore,
weren't you?

00:06:00.947 --> 00:06:02.949
-No.
-Liar.

00:06:03.157 --> 00:06:05.952
- You sent for me, headmistress?
- Snape, yes.

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:09.664
The time has come for answers, whether
he wants to give them to me or not.

00:06:10.039 --> 00:06:11.582
Have you brought the Veritaserum?

00:06:11.749 --> 00:06:14.627
I'm afraid you've used up
all my stores interrogating students.

00:06:14.794 --> 00:06:16.754
The last of it on Miss Chang.

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:23.469
Unless you wish to poison him--

00:06:23.678 --> 00:06:26.909
And I assure you, I would have
the greatest sympathy if you did.

00:06:28.683 --> 00:06:29.985
--I cannot help you.

00:06:33.062 --> 00:06:34.362
He's got Padfoot.

00:06:35.815 --> 00:06:38.249
He's got Padfoot at the place
where it's hidden.

00:06:39.777 --> 00:06:41.824
Padfoot? What is Padfoot?
Where what is hidden?

00:06:41.921 --> 00:06:43.314
What is he talking about, Snape?

00:06:50.288 --> 00:06:51.470
No idea.

00:06:56.794 --> 00:06:57.848
Very well.

00:06:59.469 --> 00:07:01.426
You give me no choice, Potter.

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:05.011
As this is an issue
of Ministry security...

00:07:05.219 --> 00:07:06.803
...you leave me with...

00:07:08.014 --> 00:07:09.064
...no alternative.

00:07:10.767 --> 00:07:12.977
The Cruciatus Curse
ought to loosen your tongue.

00:07:13.144 --> 00:07:14.604
That's illegal.

00:07:14.771 --> 00:07:17.732
What Cornelius doesn't know
won't hurt him.

00:07:25.239 --> 00:07:26.361
Tell her, Harry!

00:07:28.242 --> 00:07:29.660
Tell me what?

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:32.302
Well, if you won't tell her where it is...

00:07:33.539 --> 00:07:34.711
...I will.

00:07:36.918 --> 00:07:38.333
Where what is?

00:07:40.091 --> 00:07:41.346
Dumbledore's secret weapon.

00:07:47.261 --> 00:07:48.443
How much further?

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:50.048
Not far.

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:55.382
It had to be somewhere
students wouldn't find it accidentally.

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:01.810
What are you doing?

00:08:02.276 --> 00:08:03.520
Improvising.

00:08:12.578 --> 00:08:13.695
Well?

00:08:15.498 --> 00:08:16.685
Where is this weapon?

00:08:22.547 --> 00:08:23.869
There isn't one, is there?

00:08:27.593 --> 00:08:29.254
You were trying to trick me.

00:08:33.933 --> 00:08:35.148
You know...

00:08:36.936 --> 00:08:38.258
...I really hate children.

